  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improving Maize Value Chain through Processing</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Agriculture (Maize).Location: Mbeya, Tanzania.Summary: The proposed project will build the capacity of Khebhandza to support smallholder farmers based in Mbeya and Songwe regions on improved maize production and reduction of post- harvest losses. Another focus will be on food safety and hygiene, especially reduction of aflatoxin level through post-harvest technologies and good agronomic practices.</narrative>
  </description>
